<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Oppenheimer starts Gucci.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Oppenheimer starts Gucci.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co has started Gucci Group NV coverage with a buy recommendation, analyst Dorothy Lakner said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- She would not comment about the rating.</p>
<p>-- Gucci was up 7/8 to 72-7/8 on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
